Do NOT touch: .LLMDD/tools/cu_scope.py, any DTR file, any ITR frame file, any ITR frame or feedback file, any Scala source
Stop when the module compiles and the new symbols are importable.

ACCEPTANCE:
T005.1 coder_writes reads all attempt logs for a prefix and extracts paths from write, edit, patch and shell redirections.
T005.2 wave_writes unions git diff and untracked files and subtracts baseline_dirty.
T005.3 attribute_writes returns per-CU sets and an unattributed residual.
